Subject: [PATCH 11/31] cpufreq: elanfreq: Covert to light weight ->target() routine
Date: Mon, 12 Aug 2013 23:18:47 +0530
Message-Id: <cdec5c1bb673c7951718e9fa691d08a8e58cf175.1376329128.git.viresh.kumar@linaro.org>
